{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112057","id":2948715245,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vwdLt","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112057","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112057.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112057.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112057","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112057/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112057/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112057/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b80e98bf1b20d74c1bcebeaf57187481ffc97c31","number":112057,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve error messages with better context and helpful information","user":{"login":"moeinghaeini","id":29026780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDI2Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29026780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini","html_url":"https://github.com/moeinghaeini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moeinghaeini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis PR improves several error messages across the codebase to make them more helpful and actionable for developers.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### Multiplayer Module\n- **File**: `modules/multiplayer/scene_replication_interface.cpp`\n- **Change**: Replaced generic \"This should never happen!\" with actionable error message that explains the issue and asks for reproduction steps\n\n### Core Translation System  \n- **File**: `core/string/translation.cpp`\n- **Change**: Added direct link to GNU gettext documentation for plural forms instead of asking users to search online\n\n### Core Callable System\n- **File**: `core/variant/callable.cpp`  \n- **Change**: Improved error message to include usage guidance (check with `is_custom()` before calling `get_custom()`)\n\n### Surface Tool\n- **File**: `scene/resources/surface_tool.cpp`\n- **Change**: Standardized error messages across all methods to use consistent, clear language\n\n### Rendering Server\n- **File**: `servers/rendering/rendering_server.cpp`\n- **Change**: Enhanced surface version error with specific solution guidance (re-export from original source)\n\n## Benefits\n\n✅ **Better Developer Experience**: Error messages now provide actionable context instead of generic messages  \n✅ **Consistent Language**: Standardized error message format across similar error types  \n✅ **Documentation Links**: Added direct links to relevant documentation where helpful  \n✅ **Solution Guidance**: Included specific steps to resolve issues where applicable  \n✅ **No Functional Changes**: Only improves error messages without changing behavior\n\n## Testing\n\n- All changes are to error message strings only\n- No functional code changes\n- Error conditions remain the same, only messages are improved\n- Tested that modified files compile without issues\n\nThis follows Godot's contribution guidelines for improving user experience without changing core functionality.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://